    "project_purpose": "Set Protocol is an Ethereum protocol for creating and managing ERC-20 tokenized portfolios and index products, allowing users to gain diversified exposure to multiple crypto assets through a single token. Third-party lending-market contracts such as Compound cTokens are external dependencies or underlying assets, not Set-owned core contracts.",
